Proposed change for cevsim 45e7fa9 (main). It makes the repository's tests build and pass with g++ 13.3 on Linux x86-64.
Test sources only: 7 files, 17 lines. The engine sources are not touched.
Verified on a copy of the commit: all 24 CTest entries pass. Before the change 16 pass. Not built with MSVC or Clang.
Two of the files are under benchmarks/. If they must stay byte-identical, leave out the changes to those two files
and use variant B or C of the report (cevsim_45e7fa9_gxx_linux_issue.md in the same folder).
Everything above the first "diff --git" line is ignored by patch and git apply.

(한국어) cevsim에 알릴 글에 딸린 수정 제안이다. 설명은 docs/ses-platform/16_cevsim_executor.md의 2.1절에 있다.
cevsim 저장소에는 올리지 않았다.

